{
  "id": "osaka-2015-247ebe2ae6-q01",
  "school": "大阪大学",
  "year": "2015",
  "subject": "情报科学研究科_情报基础数学",
  "text": "求下列积分的值：\n(1) $\\displaystyle\\iiint_D z(2x^2-y^2)\\,dx\\,dy\\,dz$，其中 $D:\\ 0\\le z\\le 1-x^2-y^2$；\n(2) $\\displaystyle\\iint_D (x-y)^{\\alpha}\\,dx\\,dy\\ \\ (-1<\\alpha<0)$，其中 $D:\\ 0\\le y< x\\le 1$。",
  "knowledge_points": [
    "三重积分的降维计算",
    "极坐标变换",
    "三角函数在一周期上的积分",
    "反常积分的收敛性判断",
    "变量替换法"
  ],
  "question_type": "多元积分计算",
  "method": [
    "先对z积分把三重积分降为二重积分",
    "极坐标化简并分离角向、径向积分",
    "用t=x-y换元把含参数积分化为初等积分"
  ],
  "solution_steps": [
    "确定D在xy平面的投影为单位圆盘 x^2+y^2≤1，对每个(x,y)先对z从0到1-x^2-y^2积分",
    "得到关于(x,y)的二重积分后改用极坐标(r,θ)表示，分离角度积分与径向积分",
    "对(2)先固定x，令t=x-y把内层y积分化成t的幂函数积分，再对x积分"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "multivariable_integral",
    "template": "\\iiint_D f(x,y,z)\\,dV,\\quad \\iint_D g(x,y)\\,dA",
    "variable_count": 3
  },
  "difficulty": 3,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "(1)",
      "steps": [
        "由 $z\\ge 0$ 且 $1-x^2-y^2\\ge z$ 知必有 $x^2+y^2\\le 1$，即D在xy平面的投影为单位圆盘，对固定(x,y)，z从0到$1-x^2-y^2$。",
        "先对z积分：$\\int_0^{1-x^2-y^2}z\\,dz=\\dfrac{(1-x^2-y^2)^2}{2}$，故原积分$=\\dfrac12\\displaystyle\\iint_{x^2+y^2\\le1}(2x^2-y^2)(1-x^2-y^2)^2\\,dx\\,dy$。",
        "用极坐标$x=r\\cos\\theta,\\ y=r\\sin\\theta$：$2x^2-y^2=r^2(2\\cos^2\\theta-\\sin^2\\theta)$，且$\\int_0^{2\\pi}(2\\cos^2\\theta-\\sin^2\\theta)\\,d\\theta=2\\pi-\\pi=\\pi$（因$\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\cos^2\\theta\\,d\\theta=\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\sin^2\\theta\\,d\\theta=\\pi$）。",
        "于是原积分$=\\dfrac12\\pi\\displaystyle\\int_0^1 r^3(1-r^2)^2\\,dr$。令$u=r^2$：$\\int_0^1r^3(1-r^2)^2dr=\\dfrac12\\int_0^1u(1-u)^2du=\\dfrac12\\left(\\dfrac12-\\dfrac23+\\dfrac14\\right)=\\dfrac1{24}$。",
        "代回得结果$=\\dfrac12\\cdot\\pi\\cdot\\dfrac1{24}=\\boxed{\\dfrac{\\pi}{48}}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "(2)",
      "steps": [
        "对固定$x\\in[0,1]$，先对y积分：令$t=x-y$，当$y:0\\to x$时$t:x\\to0$，故$\\int_0^x(x-y)^{\\alpha}dy=\\int_0^xt^{\\alpha}dt=\\dfrac{x^{\\alpha+1}}{\\alpha+1}$（因$-1<\\alpha<0$保证$\\alpha+1>0$，积分收敛）。",
        "再对x积分：$\\int_0^1\\dfrac{x^{\\alpha+1}}{\\alpha+1}dx=\\dfrac1{\\alpha+1}\\cdot\\dfrac1{\\alpha+2}$（同理$\\alpha+2>0$保证收敛）。",
        "故结果为$\\boxed{\\dfrac{1}{(\\alpha+1)(\\alpha+2)}}$，且由$-1<\\alpha<0$知分母两因子均为正，结果为正有限值，与反常积分收敛性一致。"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "practice_questions": [
    {
      "text": "计算 $\\displaystyle\\int_0^1\\int_0^x (x-y)^{-1/2}\\,dy\\,dx$。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "变量替换",
        "反常积分收敛性"
      ],
      "question_type": "二重积分计算",
      "method": [
        "令t=x-y换元先积y再积x"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "换元t=x-y计算内层积分",
        "再对x积分求最终结果"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "double_integral_substitution",
        "template": "\\int_0^1\\int_0^x (x-y)^{\\alpha}\\,dy\\,dx",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 1,
      "estimated_minutes": 5,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "令$t=x-y$，内层积分$\\int_0^x(x-y)^{-1/2}dy=\\int_0^xt^{-1/2}dt=2\\sqrt x$。",
            "再对x积分：$\\int_0^12\\sqrt x\\,dx=2\\cdot\\dfrac23=\\dfrac43$。",
            "故结果为$\\dfrac43$。"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "osaka-2015-247ebe2ae6-q01-practice-01",
      "school": "大阪大学",
      "year": "2015"
    },
    {
      "text": "用极坐标计算 $\\displaystyle\\iint_{x^2+y^2\\le1}(3x^2-y^2)\\,dx\\,dy$。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "极坐标变换",
        "三角函数周期积分"
      ],
      "question_type": "二重积分计算",
      "method": [
        "极坐标变换分离角向与径向积分"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "写出$3x^2-y^2$的极坐标表达式",
        "计算角度积分与径向积分并相乘"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "polar_double_integral",
        "template": "\\iint_{x^2+y^2\\le1} f(x,y)\\,dA",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 8,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "$3x^2-y^2=r^2(3\\cos^2\\theta-\\sin^2\\theta)$，$\\int_0^{2\\pi}(3\\cos^2\\theta-\\sin^2\\theta)d\\theta=3\\pi-\\pi=2\\pi$。",
            "径向积分：$\\int_0^1r^3\\,dr=\\dfrac14$。",
            "乘积为$2\\pi\\cdot\\dfrac14=\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}$，即所求结果。"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "osaka-2015-247ebe2ae6-q01-practice-02",
