    {
      "text": "计算三重积分 $\\displaystyle\\iiint_D z\\,dV$，其中$D:\\ 0\\le z\\le 1-x^2-y^2$。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "三重积分降维",
        "极坐标变换"
      ],
      "question_type": "三重积分计算",
      "method": [
        "先对z积分再用极坐标计算平面积分"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "对z积分得到(1-x^2-y^2)^2/2",
        "用极坐标计算剩余二重积分"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "solid_of_revolution_integral",
        "template": "\\iiint_D z\\,dV,\\ D:0\\le z\\le 1-x^2-y^2",
        "variable_count": 0
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 8,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "先对z积分：$\\int_0^{1-x^2-y^2}z\\,dz=\\dfrac{(1-x^2-y^2)^2}{2}$。",
            "极坐标下$\\displaystyle\\iint_{x^2+y^2\\le1}\\dfrac{(1-r^2)^2}{2}\\,dA=\\pi\\int_0^1(1-r^2)^2r\\,dr$（角度积分给出$2\\pi$，再除以2）。",
            "令$u=r^2$：$\\int_0^1(1-r^2)^2r\\,dr=\\dfrac12\\int_0^1(1-u)^2du=\\dfrac12\\cdot\\dfrac13=\\dfrac16$，故结果为$\\pi\\cdot\\dfrac16=\\dfrac{\\pi}{6}$。"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "osaka-2015-247ebe2ae6-q01-practice-03",
