        "极坐标下分离角向与径向积分",
        "计算并合并结果"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "multivariable_integral",
        "template": "\\iiint_D z\\,g(x,y)\\,dV,\\ D:0\\le z\\le 1-x^2-y^2",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 10,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "对z积分：$\\int_0^{1-x^2-y^2}z\\,dz=\\dfrac{(1-x^2-y^2)^2}{2}$，故原积分$=\\dfrac12\\iint_{x^2+y^2\\le1}(x^2-2y^2)(1-x^2-y^2)^2dA$。",
            "极坐标下$x^2-2y^2=r^2(\\cos^2\\theta-2\\sin^2\\theta)$，$\\int_0^{2\\pi}(\\cos^2\\theta-2\\sin^2\\theta)d\\theta=\\pi-2\\pi=-\\pi$。",
            "径向部分与原题相同：$\\int_0^1r^3(1-r^2)^2dr=\\dfrac1{24}$，故结果$=\\dfrac12\\cdot(-\\pi)\\cdot\\dfrac1{24}=-\\dfrac{\\pi}{48}$。"
          ]
        }
      ],
